  "discrepancies": [
    "Kubernetes moving authentication documentation is not pinned v1.37.1 executable evidence. RS256 is explicit fixture policy; AuthenticationConfiguration has no signingAlgs field.",
    "300s JWKS TTL, 30s retry floor, 2s timeout and bounded negative cache are teaching policy, not RFC or Kubernetes defaults.",
    "OIDC ID token has no universally mandatory typ=id_token.",
    "Runtime cryptographic evidence is explicitly authored SYM evidence; independent QA never makes the runtime a cryptographic verifier."
